    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ruins are still there, the regime is gone and something is still watching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A post-communist city's crumbling concrete conceals a hidden past, with rusted machines still patrolling abandoned hallways and brutalist bunkers mixed with Roman ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep underground, you wake up without any memory. You must find your way to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/b15a26144a4cd759e1683843d98eb342.poster.avif?t=1750112014\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/b15a26144a4cd759e1683843d98eb342.webm?t=1750112014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/b15a26144a4cd759e1683843d98eb342.mp4?t=1750112014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Begin your journey</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam between <strong>underground labs</strong> and <strong>Roman relics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover remnants of the empire and its ideology, such as propaganda posters, ancient ruins and abandoned laboratories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather\u00a0<strong>items</strong> to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect\u00a0<strong>coupons</strong> to buy for gear, upgrades or essential supplies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/b2376ccfdd19996d2bd8c97b6be79cbb.poster.avif?t=1750112014\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/b2376ccfdd19996d2bd8c97b6be79cbb.webm?t=1750112014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/b2376ccfdd19996d2bd8c97b6be79cbb.mp4?t=1750112014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight your way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is sharp and situational \u2014 built on momentum, timing and improvisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use adaptive tactics to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To improve your odds and <strong>upgrade\u00a0</strong>your equipment, look for vendors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/9a79b6966e327bec88162423c35600a4.poster.avif?t=1750112014\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/9a79b6966e327bec88162423c35600a4.webm?t=1750112014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/9a79b6966e327bec88162423c35600a4.mp4?t=1750112014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies that hunt you</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not alone in the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated defence systems that were designed for a regime that no longer exists are still in use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machines act without hesitation. You can't either.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ruins are still there, the regime is gone and something is still watching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A post-communist city's crumbling concrete conceals a hidden past, with rusted machines still patrolling abandoned hallways and brutalist bunkers mixed with Roman ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep underground, you wake up without any memory. You must find your way to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/b15a26144a4cd759e1683843d98eb342.poster.avif?t=1750112014\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/b15a26144a4cd759e1683843d98eb342.webm?t=1750112014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/b15a26144a4cd759e1683843d98eb342.mp4?t=1750112014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Begin your journey</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam between <strong>underground labs</strong> and <strong>Roman relics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover remnants of the empire and its ideology, such as propaganda posters, ancient ruins and abandoned laboratories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather\u00a0<strong>items</strong> to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect\u00a0<strong>coupons</strong> to buy for gear, upgrades or essential supplies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/b2376ccfdd19996d2bd8c97b6be79cbb.poster.avif?t=1750112014\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/b2376ccfdd19996d2bd8c97b6be79cbb.webm?t=1750112014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/b2376ccfdd19996d2bd8c97b6be79cbb.mp4?t=1750112014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight your way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is sharp and situational \u2014 built on momentum, timing and improvisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use adaptive tactics to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To improve your odds and <strong>upgrade\u00a0</strong>your equipment, look for vendors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/9a79b6966e327bec88162423c35600a4.poster.avif?t=1750112014\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/9a79b6966e327bec88162423c35600a4.webm?t=1750112014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865500/extras/9a79b6966e327bec88162423c35600a4.mp4?t=1750112014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies that hunt you</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not alone in the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated defence systems that were designed for a regime that no longer exists are still in use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machines act without hesitation. You can't either.</p></li></ul>",
